## Summary

- 72 current types collapse into the new tree with 9 FLAG rows needing a decision: A04 AMSA stats treatment, D11 needle stick placement, D21 Welfare placement, B05 Flare Sighting opening type, S07 Shark Attack three-way split, Z94 Equipment Deployment, G01/G02 Event/Carnival, E06 Request for Police decompose, E11 Generic Animal home. E02 Drowning Death locks automatically when Rescue versus Recovery is settled.
- Catch-alls (E99, D99, B99) retire in favour of the Not Final mechanism.
- The shark S-series (6 sighting types) collapses to one Type plus two Tag dimensions, the biggest single simplification in the map.
- Inactive types (C01, C02, E04, E05, G01) mapped for historical comparability only.
